---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: publishSaleResults(claimRoot, acceptedCapitalRoot, totalTokens, tokenDecimals)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_stage: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_stage --> q_set_roots: block.timestamp > refundEndTime AND not already published
    q_check_stage --> q_revert_stage: invalid sale stage
    q_set_roots --> q_set_tokens: claimMerkleRoot = claimRoot, acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot = acceptedCapitalRoot
    q_set_tokens --> q_mark_published: totalTokensAllocated = totalTokens, tokenDecimalConfig = tokenDecimals
    q_mark_published --> q_emit: resultsPublished = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleResultsPublished(claimRoot, acceptedCapitalRoot, totalTokens)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_stage --> [*]: revert InvalidSaleStage

    note right of q_set_roots
        INV-001: claimMerkleRoot is immutable once set
        INV-002: totalTokensAllocated must match sum of all leaf allocations in Merkle tree
        INV-003: resultsPublished can only transition from false to true
    end note
